    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a creature grabbed.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You tuck your legs and your tail and roll rapidly onto the ground, twisting your grabbed target. You make an unarmed Strike with a +2 circumstance bonus to the attack roll against the grabbed creature. If it hits, the creature must make a Fortitude saving throw or be knocked prone. On a critical hit, the creature is knocked prone automatically. On a failure, you release the creature as your attempt fails.</span></p>"
